.md and produce a new complete superseding TASK-260720-1nvomm_external-build-repositories-architecture-v4.md. Preserve every accepted v3 section. Close the final three findings with one coherent design: add exact trusted read-only Git plumbing to the permitted child graph for both manager-owned network repositories and inert-copied local object stores, preferably one fixed cat-file --batch contract with absolute argv, clean environment, no replace/lazy fetch/optional locks/network/filters/textconv/mailmap, full-OID-only request grammar, byte-exact response grammar, bounded object count/size/depth/diagnostics, and manager parsing/recomputation of commit/tag/tree/blob IDs before audit; remove ambiguous ls-tree alternatives. Define one interoperable local packed-object admission contract, such as exact pack versions 2/3 and index version 2 with SHA-1/SHA-256 checksum/trailer rules, or an even narrower safe common subset; private config/object store must be manager-generated and source config never executed. Define an exact all-blob Git LFS pointer detector from the official pointer spec, including scan scope, size/line/extension/oid/size grammar, canonical/noncanonical policy, and stable build_repository_git_lfs_unsupported failure before audit; hydration remains forbidden. Validate exact argv with pinned Git, JSON, and primary sources. Do not edit product/spec/code or prior resources. Attach the new v4 resource and route to to-review.\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override\\nspawn launch composition: degraded_contract_unavailable; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; diagnostic=composition_contract_unavailable; bare child launch retained\\nspawn queued: [analyst] solution-architect (codex) (run=RUN-260727-54d582, max_parallel=20)\\nspawn run started: [analyst] solution-architect (codex) (run=RUN-260727-54d582)\ncreated:2026-07-20T01:44:31Z\nupdated:2026-07-27T19:11:00Z\nisBlocked:false\nisAdvisoryBlocked:false\nchildren:[]\npreconditionResources:[{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_artifact-map.puml\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_artifact-map.puml\",\"description\":\"Implementation planning diagram showing normative contract ownership and downstream consumers\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md\",\"description\":\"Accepted compile-only driver contract, verified at SHA-256 6308d99d8bdad4445841bc1cbd230cadbed0020012d0e9d38d877b413348f681\"}]\noutcomeResources:[{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_artifact-map.svg\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_artifact-map.svg\",\"description\":\"Rendered artifact ownership diagram linked to the normative contract task\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--codex-.log\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--codex-.log\",\"description\":\"System spawn log captured by task-board\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_results.md\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_results.md\",\"description\":\"Implementation scope, complete accepted-decision mapping, reviewer rework, exclusion proof, and verification results\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_validation.log\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_validation.log\",\"description\":\"Passing scoped and full validation output after reviewer-requested core corrections\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-.log\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-.log\",\"description\":\"System spawn log captured by task-board\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_review-verdict.md\",\"uri\":\"file://TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_review-verdict.md\",\"description\":\"Reviewer verdict, contract gaps, and validation evidence\"},{\"name\":\"TASK-260720-1nvomm_rework-