+The single `awk` pipeline above must run under a shell with `pipefail` enabled if used as a formal gate. A pipeline-free alternative is:
+
+```bash
+python3 - "$CONFORMANCE_ROOT/manifest.json" "$EXPECTED_MANIFEST" <<'PY'
+import hashlib
