+- Go downloads JSON: <https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json>
+- Go installation guide: <https://go.dev/doc/install>
+- Go toolchain selection: <https://go.dev/doc/toolchain>
+- Go release policy/history: <https://go.dev/doc/devel/release>
