+$env:GOENV = 'off'
+$env:GOTOOLCHAIN = 'local'
+$env:LC_ALL = 'C'
+$env:LANG = 'C'
+
+& $ApprovedGo version
+& $ApprovedGo env -json `
+  GOROOT GOHOSTOS GOHOSTARCH GOOS GOARCH GOVERSION GOTOOLCHAIN GOENV `
+  GOAMD64 GOTELEMETRY GOTELEMETRYDIR
