+Require:
+
+```text
+go version go1.25.12 windows/amd64
+GOROOT == the approved real root
+GOHOSTOS/GOOS == windows
+GOHOSTARCH/GOARCH == amd64
+GOTOOLCHAIN == local
+GOENV disabled/empty under the clean probe
